=== {{S|étymologie}} ===
: Du participe présent de ''[[build]]''.

=== {{S|nom|en}} ===
'''building''' {{pron|ˈbɪl.dɪŋ|en}} ({{p}} : [[buildings]])
# [[construction|Construction]].
# [[bâtiment|Bâtiment]].
#* {{exemple | lang=en
 | Psychologists recruited avid fans of Manchester United. Fans wrote about what ManU meant to them, and were told they would record a short video tribute to their team in another '''building'''.
 | source=Jamil Zaki, ''The War for Kindness'', 2019}}

=== {{S|verbe|en|flexion}} ===
'''building''' {{pron|ˈbɪl.dɪŋ|en}}
# ''Participe présent du verbe'' [[build]].

